# User Insights

---

## Observed Behavior Patterns
- Users prefer fast setup over deep configuration
- Trust increases when system is explainable
- Businesses want control over automation, not full replacement

---

## Key Pain Points
- Complex onboarding for non-technical users
- Lack of clarity in AI decisions during calls
- Difficulty mapping analytics to action

---

## Core Insight
Users don’t want “fully autonomous AI calls” —
they want **AI-assisted controllable calling systems**.
